-- one request answered
-- the served source (lib/host.cub, h-sync): every change it has had, in order, a line `PATH POINTER`
-- of STORE/source-log each (the path in hex, "-" for a module dropped). A session asks for the
-- changes after the last it has, takes a module's text, and changes a module only from the pointer
-- the server holds now; HYPERACTIVE_TOKEN, when the server has one, must come with every change
s-log : List Word → Proc W (List (List Word))
s-log st = bind (h-read (list-append st "/source-log")) (λ l → ret (h-lines (s-or nil l)))
